From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: ethernet: mtk_hnat: offload PPE occupancy sampling and quiet diagnostics

Move Vendor PPE occupancy scan off the datapath, drop oversized PPE WWAN
exceptions cleanly, gate packet-path diagnostics and HNAT RX tracing,
replace trace_printk in hnat_mcast.c with pr_debug, and deduplicate debugfs
and ppd_dev_setting logs.

Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/mediatek/mtk_eth_soc.c        |  10 +-
 drivers/net/ethernet/mediatek/mtk_hnat/hnat.c      |  98 ++++++++++++-
